name Goblin Camp
at 240 -200
door 48 63 1 1
flag carrying_pib
flag pib_home
quest stolen_pib The Stolen Pib
stage Find the baby pib the goblins carried off into the north.
stage Bring the baby pib back to the merchant at the caravan.
dialog merchant
line root
say Well met, traveller.
ask Show me your wares. -> grief
need flag pib_home off
ask You look troubled. What happened? -> trouble
need quest stolen_pib unstarted
ask I have your baby pib. -> thanks
need flag carrying_pib on
ask Farewell. -> end
line grief
say Forgive me. My baby pib is gone, and grief has left no room in me for trade. I will open my wares to no one until it is home.
ask What happened to it? -> trouble
need quest stolen_pib unstarted
ask Farewell. -> end
line trouble
say Every night the goblin camp up the north road sends raiders down on us, a few at a time until dawn. My guards hold the carts, but last night one slipped past them and carried off my baby pib. Will you bring it back to me?
ask I will find it. -> accepted
gets quest stolen_pib stage 1
ask That is not my problem. -> end
line accepted
say Bless you. Their camp lies up the north road, past the carts.
line thanks
say My little one! You have my thanks, traveller. Stay near my guards after dark; the raiders still come down every night.
act flag carrying_pib off
act flag pib_home on
act quest stolen_pib done
dialog baby_pib
line root
say A baby pib, tied to a stake. It squeaks at you.
ask Untie it and carry it home. -> end
gets flag carrying_pib on
gets quest stolen_pib stage 2
ask Leave it. -> end
dialog home_pib
line root
say The baby pib nuzzles the merchant's boots.
npc 1 by caravan merchant Merchant
npc 2 far baby_pib Baby pib
shows stage stolen_pib < 2
looks pib
npc 1 by caravan home_pib Baby pib
shows quest stolen_pib done
looks pib
